  clueId: lock_rota
  displayTitle: Night Rota - Back Page
  bodyText: Everyone hated locking up but her. She had a way of doing it - started
    at the bottom because she said the iron one stuck if you left it till last, then
    straight up to the top, then finished on the middle. Twice a night, for eleven
    years. You could set your watch by the sound of it.
